gu8(){return"Important risk warning"},
guJ(){return"*Please see fund documentation for details. OnlyBand Option may call more than 25% upfront if needed by the underlying investment fund. The illustrative cash flows are not intended as a demonstration or forecast of investment returns. They are provided as an example of typical cash flows for the types of investment vehicles included in the cash flow simulation. No specific cash flow is guaranteed and past performance is not indicative of future performance. Investors should only base investment decisions on the official offering documents. All forward-looking calculations are based on assumptions that OnlyBand Option believes to be reasonable, but are subject to a wide range of risks and uncertainties. Actual results may differ significantly. Investments in private equity products are high risk and investors may lose all capital. Private equity should only be a part of your overall investment portfolio. Investments are highly illiquid (typically 10+ years)."},
