guJ(){return"*Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar i\xe7in l\xfctfen fon belgelerine bak\u0131n. OnlyBand Option, temel yat\u0131r\u0131m fonunun ihtiya\xe7 duymas\u0131 halinde %25'ten fazlas\u0131n\u0131 pe\u015fin olarak \xe7a\u011f\u0131rabilir. \xd6rnek niteli\u011findeki nakit ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131n\u0131n, yat\u0131r\u0131m getirilerinin g\xf6sterilmesi veya tahmini olarak kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 ama\xe7lanmam\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Nakit ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 sim\xfclasyonuna dahil edilen yat\u0131r\u0131m arac\u0131 t\xfcrleri i\xe7in tipik nakit ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131na \xf6rnek olarak verilmi\u015ftir. Belirli bir nakit ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 garanti edilmez ve ge\xe7mi\u015f performans gelecekteki performans\u0131n g\xf6stergesi de\u011fildir. Yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lar yat\u0131r\u0131m kararlar\u0131n\u0131 yaln\u0131zca resmi arz belgelerine dayand\u0131rmal\u0131d\u0131r. \u0130leriye y\xf6nelik t\xfcm hesaplamalar, OnlyBand Option'\u0131n makul oldu\u011funa inand\u0131\u011f\u0131 varsay\u0131mlara dayanmaktad\u0131r ancak \xe7ok \xe7e\u015fitli risklere ve belirsizliklere tabidir. Ger\xe7ek sonu\xe7lar \xf6nemli \xf6l\xe7\xfcde farkl\u0131l\u0131k g\xf6sterebilir. \xd6zel sermaye \xfcr\xfcnlerine yap\u0131lan yat\u0131r\u0131mlar y\xfcksek risk ta\u015f\u0131r ve yat\u0131r\u0131mc\u0131lar sermayenin tamam\u0131n\u0131 kaybedebilir. \xd6zel sermaye, genel yat\u0131r\u0131m portf\xf6y\xfcn\xfcz\xfcn yaln\u0131zca bir par\xe7as\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r. Yat\u0131r\u0131mlar olduk\xe7a likit de\u011fildir (genellikle 10+ y\u0131l)."},
