gx8(){return"Ki\u015fisel bilgilerinizin korunmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\xe7in idari, teknik ve fiziksel g\xfcvenlik \xf6nlemleri kullan\u0131yoruz. Bize sa\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z ki\u015fisel bilgilerin g\xfcvenli\u011fini sa\u011flamak i\xe7in makul ad\u0131mlar\u0131 atm\u0131\u015f olsak da, \xe7abalar\u0131m\u0131za ra\u011fmen hi\xe7bir g\xfcvenlik \xf6nleminin m\xfckemmel veya a\u015f\u0131lamaz olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve hi\xe7bir method veri aktar\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n herhangi bir m\xfcdahaleye veya ba\u015fka t\xfcrde k\xf6t\xfcye kullan\u0131ma kar\u015f\u0131 garanti edilemeyece\u011fini l\xfctfen unutmay\u0131n."},
